            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f2" n="2" xml:id="d137-f2-content">
                <p>The week of February 6.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f3" n="3" xml:id="d137-f3-content">
                <p>
                    Carter wrote in the left margin:
                    “Ok—I’ll show Byrd the TV speech—He
                    asked.” See <ref target="#d99-f6">footnote 6, Document 99.</ref>
                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f4" n="4" xml:id="d137-f4-content">
